import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Charges and savings rates | Bloc Microfinance Bank" description="Transfer charges for Bloc personal and business accounts, loan interest, and savings and fixed deposit rates." path="/charges/" section="company" breadcrumb={[{"name": "Charges and rates", "path": "/charges/"}]}>
<section class="iph"><div class="w"><div class="ihl">
<nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Charges and rates</span></nav>
<h1>Charges and rates.</h1>
<p class="lead">Every transfer shows its fee before you confirm. This page lists our charges and savings rates in naira (₦).</p>
</div></div></section><section class="sec" id="personal-charges"><div class="w split2"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Personal</span></div>
<h2>Personal charges.</h2>
<p class="lead">In place now.</p></div>
<div class="ipt"><div class="row"><span>Transfer to a Bloc account</span><span class="v">Free</span></div><div class="row"><span>Transfer to another bank</span><span class="v">₦10</span></div><div class="row"><span>Airtime and data</span><span class="v">Free</span></div><div class="row"><span>Bill payments</span><span class="v">Free</span></div><div class="row"><span>Account statement</span><span class="v">Free</span></div><div class="row"><span>Account maintenance</span><span class="v">Free</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sky" id="business-charges"><div class="w split2"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Business</span></div>
<h2>Business charges.</h2>
<p class="lead">Effective 1 December 2026.</p></div>
<div class="ipt"><div class="row"><span>Transfer to a Bloc account</span><span class="v">Free</span></div><div class="row"><span>Transfer to another bank: below ₦5,000</span><span class="v">₦10</span></div><div class="row"><span>Transfer to another bank: ₦5,001 to ₦50,000</span><span class="v">₦25</span></div><div class="row"><span>Transfer to another bank: above ₦50,000</span><span class="v">₦50</span></div><div class="row"><span>Receiving payments into your account</span><span class="v">Free</span></div><div class="row"><span>Account statement</span><span class="v">Free</span></div><div class="row"><span>Account maintenance</span><span class="v">Free</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sky" id="rates"><div class="w"><div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Savings</span></div><h2>Savings and fixed deposit rates.</h2><p class="lead">All rates are per annum and subject to change.</p><h3 class="rth">Bloc Flex</h3><p>Flexible liquidation with penalty. Interest is paid at maturity.</p><div class="rtb"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Amount</th><th scope="col">90 days</th><th scope="col">180 days</th><th scope="col">270 days</th><th scope="col">365 days</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">₦100k to ₦4.99M</th><td>17.00%</td><td>18.00%</td><td>19.00%</td><td>20.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦5M to ₦9.99M</th><td>18.00%</td><td>19.00%</td><td>20.00%</td><td>21.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦10M to ₦49.99M</th><td>19.00%</td><td>20.00%</td><td>21.00%</td><td>22.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦50M to ₦99.99M</th><td>20.00%</td><td>21.00%</td><td>22.00%</td><td>23.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦100M and above</th><td>22.00%</td><td>23.00%</td><td>24.00%</td><td>25.00%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="rn">Early liquidation before maturity attracts a 40% penalty on accrued interest. Subject to withholding tax (WHT).</p><h3 class="rth">Bloc Lock</h3><p>Locked principal for maximum returns. Interest is paid at maturity.</p><div class="rtb"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Amount</th><th scope="col">90 days</th><th scope="col">180 days</th><th scope="col">270 days</th><th scope="col">365 days</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">₦100k to ₦4.99M</th><td>18.00%</td><td>19.00%</td><td>20.00%</td><td>21.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦5M to ₦9.99M</th><td>19.00%</td><td>20.00%</td><td>21.00%</td><td>22.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦10M to ₦49.99M</th><td>20.50%</td><td>21.50%</td><td>22.50%</td><td>23.50%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦50M to ₦99.99M</th><td>21.50%</td><td>22.50%</td><td>23.50%</td><td>24.50%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦100M and above</th><td>23.50%</td><td>24.50%</td><td>25.50%</td><td>26.50%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="rn">Fully locked. No partial or full liquidation before maturity. Any liquidation forfeits 100% of accrued interest. Subject to WHT.</p><h3 class="rth">Bloc Advance</h3><p>Interest is paid upfront at the start. Locked principal.</p><div class="rtb"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Amount</th><th scope="col">90 days</th><th scope="col">180 days</th><th scope="col">270 days</th><th scope="col">365 days</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">₦100k to ₦4.99M</th><td>15.00%</td><td>15.50%</td><td>16.00%</td><td>17.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦5M to ₦9.99M</th><td>16.00%</td><td>16.50%</td><td>17.00%</td><td>18.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦10M to ₦49.99M</th><td>17.00%</td><td>17.50%</td><td>18.00%</td><td>19.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦50M to ₦99.99M</th><td>18.00%</td><td>18.50%</td><td>19.00%</td><td>20.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">₦100M and above</th><td>20.00%</td><td>21.00%</td><td>21.50%</td><td>23.00%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="rn">If liquidated before maturity, the full upfront interest is deducted from the principal. Subject to WHT.</p><h3 class="rth">Bloc Goal</h3><p>Goal-based target savings for projects, travel, school fees or big purchases.</p><div class="ipt"><div class="row"><span>Interest rate</span><span class="v">10.00% per annum, paid monthly on the average daily balance</span></div><div class="row"><span>Minimum deposit</span><span class="v">₦5,000</span></div><div class="row"><span>Contribution</span><span class="v">Daily, weekly or monthly, by automatic debit from your main account</span></div></div><p class="rn">No liquidation before maturity. Early liquidation deducts 20% of accrued interest. Subject to WHT.</p><h3 class="rth">General terms</h3><div class="ipl"><div class="ipn"><b>Rates</b><span>Rates are subject to change.</span></div><div class="ipn"><b>Maturity</b><span>If you give no instruction before maturity, your funds are reinvested at the prevailing rate.</span></div><div class="ipn"><b>Tax</b><span>All returns are subject to withholding tax (WHT).</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sec" id="notes"><div class="w split2"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Good to know</span></div>
<h2>Loans and taxes.</h2></div>
<div class="ipl"><div class="ipn"><b>Loans</b><span>Interest is 4% to 6% flat per month. The rate you get depends on a risk assessment. We show what you pay each month before you confirm.</span></div><div class="ipn"><b>Taxes and levies</b><span>Withholding tax (WHT) of 10% applies to deposit interest.</span></div></div></div></section><section class="dl" id="download"><div class="w"><div class="dbox ch">
